
BUDGET 40
HOLD_FLASH 1
SHARE state_matrix_only

GENESIS FROM NEXUS_COORD

CUBE cube-sot     ROLE kernel_sot    PROTON 1
CUBE cube-coord   ROLE coord         PROTON 1
CUBE cube-llama   ROLE llama         PROTON 1
CUBE cube-host    ROLE host_station  PROTON 1
CUBE cube-quest   ROLE quest_lizard  PROTON 1
CUBE cube-wivrn   ROLE wivrn_way     PROTON 1
CUBE cube-kinect  ROLE kinect        PROTON 1
CUBE cube-create  ROLE construct     PROTON 1
CUBE cube-destroy ROLE deconstruct   PROTON 0
CUBE cube-hive    ROLE nanobot_hive  PROTON 1

PLUG RING
PLUG cube-create cube-destroy

IMPULSE cube-create 1
IMPULSE cube-hive 1

TICK 3
VIZ "state/viz_frame.json"

ASSERT CUBES >= 10
ASSERT 1 == 1
PRINT "prophecy_cubes" CUBES
